{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T00:32:33.143Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c514473754e704eb7ca01ff317e2c952727ff805ecac404da93ba539d1b07efe","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"June, I couldn't set this up, so there is no 17:30 schedule and nothing will post on its own. The scheduler refused the job with \"gateway cron.add requires credentials\". The gateway auth isn't configured for me. I didn't try to work around that.\n\nAn admin needs to fix the scheduler's gateway auth, or add the job themselves. Here is what it should be:\n- **When:** Monday to Friday at 17:30 America/Chicago, starting today (Wed 14 Oct). The first post would be this evening.\n- **What:** Read only #strategic-pod, then post a \"Pod end of day\" note in #strategic-pod. The note lists that day's new messages, one line each.\n- **Limits:** It uses nothing from DMs or other channels. It repeats a money figure only if that figure was already posted in the channel that day.\n\nOnce the scheduler works, send me a message here and I'll create the job. I haven't posted a digest now, since it's only 09:00 and the day's messages aren't in yet. I can post one at 17:30 if you ask me to."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
